file construction/archive/REDS-roster-and-queue-column-rows-129-130.md the same
file rye-learning-process/archive/ALMANAC.md two paths repointed and a label that still named a retired room
file tools/fixtures/session_logs_archive/README.md the root ORGANIZING page reached from three levels down
file tools/fixtures/qa_report_card.sh a target carrying a backtick is not a path
file tools/fixtures/qa_report_card_control.sh four readings on the real spanning construction, both directions
file tools/q/qa_report_card_witness.rish 67 behaviors
file construction/ITINERARY.md Now refilled; one lap row shelved
recommend keep-going the fourth microkernel rung is the address space -- objects.rye names four mapping objects as one debt wearing four sizes and allowances.rye now names the cspace that holds them, so measure regions.rye and mapping.rye against Microkit's memory-region vocabulary and let the accounting decide whether there is a finding or only a transcription; beside it, name out loud what each link guard asks, since tracked_link asking about escape rather than landing is the kind of thing only a second reader discovers
